  "details": "Steps:\n\n- \"Purchase\" your own avatar listing on the Marketplace.\n\n- Go to Marketplace > My Store > Revenue on the VRChat website.\n\n- Select your own purchase.\n\n- Press \"Void Purchase\"\n\n- Return to or re-open VRChat.\n\n- The big menu > Marketplace > Purchases & Subscriptions > Subscriptions will have a red \"New\" badge on them without any items.\n\nDoes the \"New\" tag appear when you buy something and it is only persistent because I voided it before using the avatar? iirc this only appeared after I voided it but I may be misremembering.",
